    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Last Renovation</strong></i> is an unusual horror game with a mix of absurdity and humor. The player takes on the role of Hubert, who embarks on a nighttime mission to retrieve stolen tools from his neighbor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/548ffd502fc9a4beaef4519ef13afbbe.avif?t=1747324729\" width=600 height=156 /></span>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Tool Collection</strong> \u2013 Your goal is to recover 16 tools hidden around the house. Each tool makes things more chaotic!  <br>  <br>\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Stealth &amp; Evasion</strong> \u2013 The neighbor isn\u2019t just standing around! He patrols the house, watches TV, eats toast, and uses the toilet. But if he spots you\u2026 the hunt begins.  <br>  <br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Hiding Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Sneak into wardrobes, hide under beds, in the shower, or even in the trash can. But beware \u2013 some hiding spots aren\u2019t as safe as they seem\u2026  <br>  <br>\ud83d\udd29 <strong>Interactive Environment</strong> \u2013 Pick up and throw objects, open doors, turn lights on and off, use the computer, order pizza, play the radio, start a fan, and more! <br> <br>\ud83d\udea8 <strong>Traps &amp; Obstacles</strong> \u2013 The more tools you collect, the trickier it gets! Watch out for alarms, security cameras, tripwires, slippery floors, and other surprises. <br> <br>\ud83d\ude31 <strong>Unexpected Visitors</strong> \u2013 It\u2019s not just you and the neighbor. Over time, new characters appear.   <br> <br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Increasing Tension &amp; Chaos</strong> \u2013 At first, the neighbor is calm. But the more tools you gather, the <strong>crazier he gets! </strong><br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602100/extras/046becc51a571fdf772a5df8139279c3.avif?t=1747324729\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Ready for a thrilling challenge? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in, stay quiet, and see if you can outsmart the neighbor! \ud83d\udd26\ud83d\udeaa</p>",
